{
"recipe_id":"3 Brasied Pork Tofu Sauce",
"source_text":"Recipe text:  \n1. 五花肉切成小块，冷水下锅，加入姜片、葱段、料酒，焯水去腥。焯水前可以先用盐揉洗猪肉，再清洗干净。\n2. 焯好的五花肉用纸巾擦干水分。开小火，锅中可不放油或放少量油，加入五花肉翻炒，将多余油脂煸出。不要煸太久，避免肉变硬。\n3. 另起锅放少许油，加入冰糖，小火炒出糖色，等糖浆呈香油色并开始冒泡。\n4. 放入煎好的五花肉炒至上色，加入少量老抽和生抽翻炒均匀，再加入八角、桂皮、香叶。\n5. 加入热水没过五花肉，大火烧开后转小火炖煮约 50 分钟。\n6. 最后加入盐调味，大火收汁即可。放盐时也可以加入少量红豆腐乳或腐乳汤调色调味。",
"text_steps":[{"id": "S001", "text": "五花肉切成小块", "text_en": "Cut the pork belly into small chunks.", "start_char": 18, "end_char": 25, "node_indices": [1, 2], "edge_indices": [1], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 1, "edge_index": 1, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 1, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S002", "text": "先用盐揉洗猪肉", "text_en": "First rub-wash the pork with salt before blanching.", "start_char": 52, "end_char": 59, "node_indices": [2, 3, 4], "edge_indices": [2], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 2, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 3, "edge_index": 2, "role": "context"}, {"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 2, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S003", "text": "再清洗干净", "text_en": "Then rinse the pork thoroughly.", "start_char": 60, "end_char": 64, "node_indices": [4, 5], "edge_indices": [3], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 3, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 3, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S004", "text": "冷水下锅", "text_en": "Put the pork into a pot of cold water.", "start_char": 26, "end_char": 30, "node_indices": [5, 6, 7], "edge_indices": [4, 5], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 4, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 4, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 5, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 5, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S005", "text": "加入姜片", "text_en": "Add ginger slices.", "start_char": 31, "end_char": 35, "node_indices": [7, 8], "edge_indices": [6], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 6, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 6, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S006", "text": "葱段", "text_en": "Add scallion segments.", "start_char": 36, "end_char": 38, "node_indices": [7, 9], "edge_indices": [7], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 9, "edge_index": 7, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 7, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S007", "text": "料酒", "text_en": "Add cooking wine.", "start_char": 39, "end_char": 41, "node_indices": [7, 10], "edge_indices": [8], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 8, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 8, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S008", "text": "焯水去腥", "text_en": "Blanch the pork to remove its odor.", "start_char": 42, "end_char": 46, "node_indices": [7, 11], "edge_indices": [9], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 9, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 9, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S009", "text": "焯好的五花肉用纸巾擦干水分", "text_en": "Pat the blanched pork belly dry with a paper towel.", "start_char": 70, "end_char": 83, "node_indices": [11, 12], "edge_indices": [10], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 10, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 10, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S010", "text": "开小火", "text_en": "Turn the heat to low.", "start_char": 84, "end_char": 87, "node_indices": [13, 14], "edge_indices": [11], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 13, "edge_index": 11, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 11, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S011", "text": "锅中可不放油或放少量油", "text_en": "Optionally add a small amount of oil to the pan, or use none.", "start_char": 88, "end_char": 99, "node_indices": [14, 15], "edge_indices": [12], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 12, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 12, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S012", "text": "加入五花肉翻炒，将多余油脂煸出", "text_en": "Add the pork belly and stir-fry it to render out the excess fat.", "start_char": 100, "end_char": 115, "node_indices": [12, 14, 16], "edge_indices": [13, 14], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 13, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 13, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 14, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 16, "edge_index": 14, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S013", "text": "另起锅放少许油", "text_en": "Put a little oil in another pan.", "start_char": 132, "end_char": 139, "node_indices": [17, 18], "edge_indices": [15], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 18, "edge_index": 15, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 17, "edge_index": 15, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S014", "text": "加入冰糖", "text_en": "Add rock sugar.", "start_char": 140, "end_char": 144, "node_indices": [17, 19], "edge_indices": [16], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 16, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 17, "edge_index": 16, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S015", "text": "小火炒出糖色，等糖浆呈香油色并开始冒泡", "text_en": "Cook over low heat until the sugar caramelizes and the syrup turns sesame-oil-colored and begins to bubble.", "start_char": 145, "end_char": 164, "node_indices": [17, 20], "edge_indices": [17], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 17, "edge_index": 17, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 20, "edge_index": 17, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S016", "text": "放入煎好的五花肉", "text_en": "Add the previously fried pork belly.", "start_char": 169, "end_char": 177, "node_indices": [16, 20], "edge_indices": [18], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 16, "edge_index": 18, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 20, "edge_index": 18, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S017", "text": "炒至上色", "text_en": "Stir-fry until the pork takes on color.", "start_char": 177, "end_char": 181, "node_indices": [20, 21], "edge_indices": [19], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 20, "edge_index": 19, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 21, "edge_index": 19, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S018", "text": "加入少量老抽", "text_en": "Add a small amount of dark soy sauce.", "start_char": 182, "end_char": 188, "node_indices": [21, 22], "edge_indices": [20], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 22, "edge_index": 20, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 21, "edge_index": 20, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S019", "text": "和生抽", "text_en": "Add light soy sauce.", "start_char": 188, "end_char": 191, "node_indices": [21, 23], "edge_indices": [21], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 23, "edge_index": 21, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 21, "edge_index": 21, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S020", "text": "翻炒均匀", "text_en": "Stir-fry until evenly combined.", "start_char": 191, "end_char": 195, "node_indices": [21, 24], "edge_indices": [22], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 21, "edge_index": 22, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 24, "edge_index": 22, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S021", "text": "再加入八角", "text_en": "Then add star anise.", "start_char": 196, "end_char": 201, "node_indices": [24, 25], "edge_indices": [23], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 25, "edge_index": 23, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 24, "edge_index": 23, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S022", "text": "桂皮", "text_en": "Add cinnamon.", "start_char": 202, "end_char": 204, "node_indices": [24, 26], "edge_indices": [24], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 26, "edge_index": 24, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 24, "edge_index": 24, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S023", "text": "香叶", "text_en": "Add bay leaf.", "start_char": 205, "end_char": 207, "node_indices": [24, 27], "edge_indices": [25], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 27, "edge_index": 25, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 24, "edge_index": 25, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S024", "text": "加入热水没过五花肉", "text_en": "Add enough hot water to cover the pork belly.", "start_char": 212, "end_char": 221, "node_indices": [24, 28], "edge_indices": [26], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 28, "edge_index": 26, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 24, "edge_index": 26, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S025", "text": "大火烧开", "text_en": "Bring it to a boil over high heat.", "start_char": 222, "end_char": 226, "node_indices": [24, 29, 30], "edge_indices": [27, 28], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 24, "edge_index": 27, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 29, "edge_index": 27, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 29, "edge_index": 28, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 30, "edge_index": 28, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S026", "text": "转小火炖煮约 50 分钟", "text_en": "Reduce to low heat and simmer for about 50 minutes.", "start_char": 227, "end_char": 239, "node_indices": [30, 31], "edge_indices": [29], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 30, "edge_index": 29, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 31, "edge_index": 29, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S027", "text": "最后加入盐调味", "text_en": "Finally, add salt to season.", "start_char": 244, "end_char": 251, "node_indices": [31, 32], "edge_indices": [30], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 32, "edge_index": 30, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 31, "edge_index": 30, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S028", "text": "大火收汁即可", "text_en": "Reduce the sauce over high heat to finish.", "start_char": 252, "end_char": 258, "node_indices": [31, 35], "edge_indices": [33], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 31, "edge_index": 33, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 35, "edge_index": 33, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S029", "text": "放盐时也可以加入少量红豆腐乳", "text_en": "When adding salt, you may also add a small amount of red fermented tofu.", "start_char": 259, "end_char": 273, "node_indices": [31, 33], "edge_indices": [31], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 33, "edge_index": 31, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 31, "edge_index": 31, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S030", "text": "或腐乳汤调色调味", "text_en": "Or add fermented-tofu liquid for color and flavor.", "start_char": 273, "end_char": 281, "node_indices": [31, 34], "edge_indices": [32], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 34, "edge_index": 32, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 31, "edge_index": 32, "role": "receiver"}]}],
